60e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">52:58</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1109</span></div>\n<h2>纽约收垃圾没有现成卡车可用：政府花10个月自己设计了一辆</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">因为没有适合纽约街道的自动侧装卡车，抄欧洲方案又要等五年，纽约市环卫局干脆亲自下场把车设计出来，只用了十个月。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">城市治理</span><span class=\"tag\">垃圾处理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"#415 ‒ AMA #91: Understanding lab testing: what blood work can and cannot tell you about your health and disease risk DTC testing\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-09-thepeterattiad-血检再全面-也只能揭示两到三成的健康风险全貌/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d415dc8503c1c8f1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">17:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">The Peter Attia Drive</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1109</span></div>\n<h2>血检再全面，也只能揭示两到三成的健康风险全貌</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Peter Attia在这期AMA里给出一个具体数字：即便是最全面的血液检测，也只能提供他评估患者风险所需信息的25%到30%，剩下的需要靠影像、体成分和纵向追踪补齐。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">血液检测</span><span class=\"tag\">健康风险评估</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Are We Cooking!? What Should Dems Do Next + Jensen&#x27;s Affair MSS MATCH Act Section 232 USMCA\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-09-chinatalk-得州州长选举爆冷-反数据中心情绪一夜抹去近万亿美元市值/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3ba219ec92b9bc66-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:05:26</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1109</span></div>\n<h2>得州州长选举爆冷，反数据中心情绪一夜抹去近万亿美元市值</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">反数据中心情绪从来不是「自由派恨科技」的故事，而是跨党派共识，已经强到能掀翻一场州长选举、让华尔街措手不及地蒸发巨额市值。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">数据中心</span><span class=\"tag\">中期选举</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"A Deep Dive on Submarines X-Craft bathyscaphe SSN\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-09-historyhit-击沉贝尔格拉诺号前-副艇长曾当众喝止艇长的开火令/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6775897482174464-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">51:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">History Hit</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1109</span></div>\n<h2>击沉贝尔格拉诺号前，副艇长曾当众喝止艇长的开火令</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">核潜艇「征服者」号击沉阿根廷巡洋舰贝尔格拉诺号前，副指挥官麦克莱蒙曾在控制室喝止艇长，只为等一个更好的射击角度——那是英国潜艇自二战以来首次真正开火。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">潜艇史</span><span class=\"tag\">二战海战</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"721. The Charge of the Light Brigade: Outbreak of The Crimean War (Part 1) sublime port plunger cavalry drawl black bottle affair sick man of Europe\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-09-restishistory-克里米亚战争真正的导火索-只是伯利恒教堂一把钥匙的归属之争/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/607aa1e9567d043b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:10:13</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Rest Is History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1109</span></div>\n<h2>克里米亚战争真正的导火索，只是伯利恒教堂一把钥匙的归属之争</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">克里米亚战争由伯利恒教堂一把钥匙的归属之争点燃，英法俄三大国在互相猜忌和误判中，像后来的一战列强一样梦游般卷入了这场冲突。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">克里米亚战争</span><span class=\"tag\">维多利亚时代</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How Cisco Got Bullwhipped Bullwhip effect Virtual close Extranet Keiretsu Vendor financing Contract manufacturer\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-09-asianometry-思科自夸能实时看清全球需求-其实看到的是客户重复下的订单/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><div class=\"fallback\">A</div><span class=\"dur\">31:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Asianometry</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1109</span></div>\n<h2>思科自夸能实时看清全球需求，其实看到的是客户重复下的订单</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">思科两个季度库存分别暴涨87%和58.8%，根源不是需求爆发，而是客户为抢缺货重复下单，又被「实时供应链」原样放大转发给了上游。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">供应链管理</span><span class=\"tag\">牛鞭效应</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"411. Lawrence of Arabia: The Truth Behind The Legend (Part 1) Seven Pillars of Wisdom Carchemish Wilderness of Zin Arab Bureau McMahon-Hussein Correspondence\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-09-empirehist-阿拉伯的劳伦斯私下写道-犹太人耕种的农场才是沙漠里的亮点/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6dcfd4bf69c91d0f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">54:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Empire 世界史</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1109</span></div>\n<h2>阿拉伯的劳伦斯私下写道：犹太人耕种的农场才是沙漠里的亮点</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">劳伦斯以「阿拉伯解放者」留名青史，但他亲眼见证巴勒斯坦的犹太移民农场后，写下的却是「犹太人耕种得越快越好」，这与后世赋予他的形象形成巨大反差。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中东史</span><span class=\"tag\">一战</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"[One Million AI Engineer Special] How Stanford Teaches AI-Native Engineering — Mihail Eric, Monaco RPI framework sub-agent God box context engineering software factory Manager of Agents\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-08-latentspace-ai让新工程师入职门槛直逼高级工程师水平/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cb1a6f8e94a7eb56-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">2:00:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1108</span></div>\n<h2>AI让新工程师入职门槛直逼高级工程师水平</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI工具已经把基础代码工作做得足够好，企业现在要的是能做架构决策和设计取舍的人，所以新毕业生的技能标准被整体拉高了一级。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI编程</span><span class=\"tag\">工程教育</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why PMs are suddenly valuable again | Tulsee Doshi (Head of Product, Gemini) harness Pareto curve of cost to quality chain of thought monitoring flash teams Monk skin tone scale Fitzpatrick scale\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-08-lennys-人人都能一键开发时-pm的核心价值变成了审美与取舍/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8b981f0ab567ea7c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">58:33</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Lenny&#x27;s Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1108</span></div>\n<h2>人人都能一键开发时，PM的核心价值变成了审美与取舍</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">模型人人能调，能跑起来的东西不再稀缺；能从一堆能做的事里挑出真正值得做的那一件，才是PM重新被需要的原因。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">产品管理</span><span class=\"tag\">模型评测</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"HoP 503 Free Market: Dutch Capitalism VOC WIC mercantilism amour propre stadtholder joint-stock company\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-08-hopwag-荷兰资本主义不是新教伦理的产物-而是中世纪经济自然演化的结果/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ec115ed691f40c47-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">23:20</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">History of Philosophy Without Any Gaps</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1108</span></div>\n<h2>荷兰资本主义不是新教伦理的产物，而是中世纪经济自然演化的结果</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">经济史学家如今认为，加尔文教与资本主义是在荷兰自由土壤里平行生长、彼此强化，而非新教伦理催生了资本主义精神。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">资本主义史</span><span class=\"tag\">荷兰共和国</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"TWiV 1373: Challenging Dengue and RIGging Flu ADE (antibody-dependent enhancement) EDE (envelope dimer epitope) RIG-I RNAemia Pol III non-coding RNA\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-08-twiv-登革疫苗挑战试验发现-病毒复制太猛或太弱都练不出持久免疫/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://www.microbe.tv/wp-content/uploads/2018/09/TWiV_v3_white.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:49:31</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Virology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1108</span></div>\n<h2>登革疫苗挑战试验发现：病毒复制太猛或太弱都练不出持久免疫</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">二次登革感染中病毒载量适中者免疫记忆最强，载量过高反而因IL-12驱动的短命抗体而更快失效，打破了复制越少越安全的直觉。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">登革热</span><span class=\"tag\">抗体依赖增强</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Year of Five Emperors donative Caesar\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-08-ancients-罗马帝位争夺战-决定胜负的不是血统-而是离罗马有多近/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/38988d274dfcdf54-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">47:26</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Ancients</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1108</span></div>\n<h2>罗马帝位争夺战：决定胜负的不是血统，而是离罗马有多近</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">193年争夺罗马帝位的五人中，真正决定胜负的是消息传递速度——塞维鲁比对手早七天得知先帝遇刺的消息，便抢先起兵拿下帝位。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">罗马史</span><span class=\"tag\">帝位继承</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"AI:AM: Is THIS the AI We Want? Alarming Acceleration, AI Election Bets, GPU Trading &amp; AI-Native VC Responsible Scaling Policy (RSP) BallotBench Move 37 HGX node PostTrainBench\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-07-cogrev-anthropic研发加速已证实-推手不是算力-是算法和数据/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ec28c976f21f448e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:27:31</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1107</span></div>\n<h2>Anthropic研发加速已证实：推手不是算力，是算法和数据</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Anthropic在IPO文件中承认研发可能已经「戏剧性加速」，METR的独立评估显示：这波提速靠的不是更多算力，而是算法和数据质量本身被现有智能推着变好。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力</span><span class=\"tag\">数据中心</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Midterm Blood Bath, $4T AI Sell Off, Data Center Freeze, What&#x27;s Next for Trump Exponential Time Hypothesis (ETH) P vs NP hyperscalers neoclouds ring of Sauron\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-07-allin-共和党历史性惨败-选民不分左右-只惩罚解决不了民生的当权者/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a68aa6b09f666cd4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">1:33:04</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1107</span></div>\n<h2>共和党历史性惨败：选民不分左右，只惩罚解决不了民生的当权者</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">节目复盘发现，砸钱助选和重划选区这两件「意识形态武器」全都没用：真正决定中期选举的，是特朗普净支持率从+5%崩到-28%背后的汽油价、柴油价和房贷利率。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中期选举</span><span class=\"tag\">数据中心</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How To Build The Future: Paul Graham &amp; Amjad Masad vibe coding harness self-driving company\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-07-ycsp-软件外包行业基本死了-十万美元的项目现在只要一千美元/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cd057bb57d2a99d5-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">44:14</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Y Combinator</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1107</span></div>\n<h2>软件外包行业基本死了：十万美元的项目现在只要一千美元</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Replit能让LLM连续调用工具、循环运行直到任务真正完成，而不是像ChatGPT那样一轮就停——这才是vibe coding的技术突破，也是Masad判断传统软件外包行业已经死掉的底气。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">vibe coding</span><span class=\"tag\">企业软件</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Skeptics Guide #1113 - Nov 7 2026 Lean sortition Navier-Stokes equation mathpocalypse action bias\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-07-skeptics-openai-一天甩出722篇数学论文-数学家集体看懵/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cc4dc31b3b84e70d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">2:06:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Skeptics Guide</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1107</span></div>\n<h2>OpenAI 一天甩出722篇数学论文，数学家集体看懵</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">论文长达数百页却读不懂、也查不完，OpenAI只甩出部分Lean验证代码自证严谨，逼数学界承认人类可能真的跟不上AI证明的速度了。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI与数学</span><span class=\"tag\">公共卫生</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"SYMHC Classics: Princess Who Swallowed a Glass Piano glass delusion melancholia House of Wittelsbach\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-07-stuffmissed-她坚信自己吞下了一整架玻璃钢琴-这种妄想曾在欧洲流行数百年/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">18:20</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1107</span></div>\n<h2>她坚信自己吞下了一整架玻璃钢琴，这种妄想曾在欧洲流行数百年</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">从中世纪到19世纪初，欧洲反复出现「我是玻璃做的」这种妄想——法国国王查理六世不许人碰，御医曾放火烧床逼病人跳起来「治愈」他。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">历史</span><span class=\"tag\">精神疾病史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"锐评国模与 Neo Lab，畅谈 RL 人生与 RLaaS | 对谈 Mind Lab 首席科学家骁腾 RSI LoRA harness discount factor GRPO\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-07-zhangjing-大厂做不出最好的模型-不是技术问题-是账本问题/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e1cd1b4b05d9c6c1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"4\"><span class=\"dur\">1:02:57</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">42章经</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1107</span></div>\n<h2>大厂做不出最好的模型：不是技术问题，是账本问题</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">骁腾认为大厂的问题不是缺卡缺钱，而是财务账单逼着管理层把实验室产出做转化，这种向心力让突破性创新很难发生在大厂内部，但它们仍能靠置换算力稳赚钱。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>2</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">强化学习</span><span class=\"tag\">后训练</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Martin Wolf on Democratic Capitalism After Trump competitive authoritarianism dirty democracy positional goods citizens&#x27; assembly rentier\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-07-goodfight-专家阶层自毁信誉的代价-没人能再管住会-终结人类-的ai/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c75b9a8ba0dff85c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">The Good Fight</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1107</span></div>\n<h2>专家阶层自毁信誉的代价：没人能再管住会「终结人类」的AI</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">沃尔夫说，知识分子阶层已被民粹政治打垮，以至于连Anthropic自己披露「可能终结人类」的风险都无人深究。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">民主衰退</span><span class=\"tag\">AI存在性风险</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Mark Hyman’s Guide to Living Longer and Staying Strong Peptide Plasmapheresis Urolithin A\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-07-a16z-肌肉是长寿的硬通货-glp-1减重药正在悄悄拿走它/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">30:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1107</span></div>\n<h2>肌肉是长寿的硬通货：GLP-1减重药正在悄悄拿走它</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Hyman说肌肉是决定衰弱与否的关键资产，而当下流行的GLP-1减重药在让人瘦的同时大量流失肌肉，这才是真正该警惕的副作用。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">长寿医学</span><span class=\"tag\">蛋白质与肌肉</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"TWiV 1372: Clinical Update with Dr. Daniel Griffin low-dose naltrexone (LDN) target trial emulation screwworm parosmia / phantosmia autochthonous\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-07-twiv-美国时隔三十年再现麻疹死亡-疫苗怀疑论政策付出代价/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://www.microbe.tv/wp-content/uploads/2018/09/TWiV_v3_white.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">52:47</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Virology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1107</span></div>\n<h2>美国时隔三十年再现麻疹死亡：疫苗怀疑论政策付出代价</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">本周美国报告三例本可用疫苗完全预防的麻疹死亡——纽约州三十年来首例、威斯康星州三十六年来首例——Daniel Griffin 把这归咎于卫生高层散布的疫苗错误信息，而不是单纯的公共卫生运气不好。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">麻疹</span><span class=\"tag\">疫苗政策</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Deep Dive: Anthropic S-1 Myths and Mythos — Jamin Ball, Altimeter S-1 converts Jevons Paradox offtake neocloud compute margin\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-07-latentspace-anthropic招股书最大误读-千亿美元可转债不是欠的债/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c081d94ef2cea125-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:42:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1107</span></div>\n<h2>Anthropic招股书最大误读：千亿美元可转债不是欠的债</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">资产负债表上1080亿美元的可转换票据负债，只是Google、Amazon所持股权随公司估值暴涨而产生的会计重估，不是真实欠款。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">IPO</span><span class=\"tag\">招股书</span>\n</div></div></a>"]